{"case_id": "M03", "sample": "A", "root_url": "https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/issues/24872", "root_created_at": "2023-01-03T11:04:48Z", "root_author": "benmaier", "request_type": "usage", "first_strategy": "mixed", "information_score": 4, "original_grade": "U", "exposure": false, "t0_seal_sha": "9de54923257d613359348c8ccee2ff8225c8a0d8", "direct_read_utc": "2026-11-22T07:30:54.727312+00:00", "root30_end": "2023-02-02T11:04:48Z", "root90_end": "2023-04-03T11:04:48Z", "root30_status": "complete_public_snapshot", "root90_status": "complete_public_snapshot", "strict_first_question": false, "broad_first_question": true, "any_question_root30": false, "later_first_clarification": null, "messages": [{"comment_id": 1369957180, "url": "https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/issues/24872#issuecomment-1369957180", "utc": "2023-01-03T16:15:43Z", "author": "story645", "role": "MEMBER", "root_author": false, "body_sha256": "3e16edc75670da9aee54addd547e1732032ba81e75b18b0d3537cb9a0aef4ed0", "last_edited_utc": null, "within_root30": true, "within_root90": true, "summary": "관련 addfont 문서/작업이 원목적에 맞는지 평가를 요청."}, {"comment_id": 1370065191, "url": "https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/issues/24872#issuecomment-1370065191", "utc": "2023-01-03T17:56:45Z", "author": "benmaier", "role": "NONE", "root_author": true, "body_sha256": "38153bf1ad97b28e0904a901c511648aacef0fd6c13d04a337b87d60211c411b", "last_edited_utc": null, "within_root30": true, "within_root90": true, "summary": "작성자가 addfont 시도는 세션 한정이라 영속 목표에 맞지 않는다고 답하고 필요하면 기능요청하겠다고 함. 시도시점 자체는 불명."}, {"comment_id": 1370331856, "url": "https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/issues/24872#issuecomment-1370331856", "utc": "2023-01-03T23:36:37Z", "author": "tacaswell", "role": "MEMBER", "root_author": false, "body_sha256": "766a3543411121f694f768f3fe573116a610c22586fc62b8a276034da40fef3a", "last_edited_utc": null, "within_root30": true, "within_root90": true, "summary": "다른 지원자가 fontlist-v330.json 및 검색경로 소스를 설명하며 사용자의 경로는 작동해야 한다고 답함."}, {"comment_id": 1370332943, "url": "https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/issues/24872#issuecomment-1370332943", "utc": "2023-01-03T23:38:51Z", "author": "benmaier", "role": "NONE", "root_author": true, "body_sha256": "87abc67f12d6a2cd9c55f4db70ae0b8342141cb3291c2d9d38bd6ce4cf9fb746", "last_edited_utc": null, "within_root30": true, "within_root90": true, "summary": "원작성자가 cache 파일 위치와 재생성 방법을 역으로 묻는다."}, {"comment_id": 1370830375, "url": "https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/issues/24872#issuecomment-1370830375", "utc": "2023-01-04T11:48:34Z", "author": "oscargus", "role": "MEMBER", "root_author": false, "body_sha256": "b836aef727dddd80124289f7c2e3e9ac5cf29520fee3465f48d8713cd667fcce", "last_edited_utc": "2023-01-04T11:49:27Z", "within_root30": true, "within_root90": true, "summary": "다른 지원자가 cache 예상 위치와 MPLCONFIGDIR 영향을 설명. 댓글은53초 뒤 수정됨."}, {"comment_id": 1370892263, "url": "https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/issues/24872#issuecomment-1370892263", "utc": "2023-01-04T12:50:21Z", "author": "benmaier", "role": "NONE", "root_author": true, "body_sha256": "befba4f6c94a945da5962038b57eededf86867bfd04fe4f1b8a0dec2a84356d6", "last_edited_utc": null, "within_root30": true, "within_root90": true, "summary": "작성자가 ~/.cache/matplotlib/의 cache를 삭제하니 작동했다고 보고. MPLCONFIGDIR은 비어 있었음. 문서개선 요구는 유지."}, {"comment_id": 1371139050, "url": "https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/issues/24872#issuecomment-1371139050", "utc": "2023-01-04T16:21:19Z", "author": "tacaswell", "role": "MEMBER", "root_author": false, "body_sha256": "01c009b2ec790f2846f009685611e5c9c21bf0b2637431de8051690449b6b038", "last_edited_utc": null, "within_root30": true, "within_root90": true, "summary": "지원자가 공개 cache재생성 API의 필요성을 제안. 작성자 실행과 별개 공급자 설계."}, {"comment_id": 1371193584, "url": "https://github.com/matplotlib/matplotlib/issues/24872#issuecomment-1371193584", "utc": "2023-01-04T17:08:16Z", "author": "jklymak", "role": "MEMBER", "root_author": false, "body_sha256": "4bce22a47ddf4094